  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "note": "Word lists for pain-wording lint, matched case-insensitively on word boundaries. Generic, hype and regional words come from tools/possibilities/config/banned-phrases.json. 'loaded' terms are one-sided: people with different views would not both use them. 'graphic' terms only add a note on pains tagged sensitive, never a failure (founder, 2026-10-19: we're not here to deny reality). 'clinical' terms in a line are a diagnosis; the copy guide asks for what someone would say out loud. 'stopwords' are ignored when matching an ID to its name and line, and when judging whether a line has anything to picture. 'similarityStopwords' are also ignored when review-build looks for likely duplicates (stems of four letters, at least two shared and 40% of the shorter pain). Edit freely; changes are reviewable in git.",
